       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-OPEN-DISCOVERY-CLOSURE-STRATEGY.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-DISCOVERY-BOUNDARY.
           05  WS-ALGEBRAIC-CLOSURE-MET    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-OPEN-DISCOVERY-ACTIVE    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-NO-CLOSED-SYSTEM-STALL   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-UNBOUNDED-CREATIVITY-MET PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-STABILITY-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-DYNAMIC-EQUILIBRIUM-MET  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-DISCOVERY-CODE     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-ASSERT-CLOSURE-FOUNDATION.
           PERFORM 2000-ASSERT-OPEN-EXPLORATION.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-OPEN-STABILITY.
           GOBACK.
       1000-ASSERT-CLOSURE-FOUNDATION.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ALGEBRAIC-CLOSURE-MET.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-NO-CLOSED-SYSTEM-STALL.
       2000-ASSERT-OPEN-EXPLORATION.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-OPEN-DISCOVERY-ACTIVE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-UNBOUNDED-CREATIVITY-MET.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-OPEN-STABILITY.
           IF WS-ALGEBRAIC-CLOSURE-MET = 1 AND
              WS-OPEN-DISCOVERY-ACTIVE = 1 AND
              WS-NO-CLOSED-SYSTEM-STALL = 1 AND
              WS-UNBOUNDED-CREATIVITY-MET = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-DYNAMIC-EQUILIBRIUM-MET
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-DISCOVERY-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-DYNAMIC-EQUILIBRIUM-MET
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-DISCOVERY-CODE.
